      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当我做出决定人生的抉择时，\n双手一定会汗湿得令人难受。\n我会感到焦急、困惑、迷惘，最后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3728de0edf502d3a06cb7073f78be82caf6e328dc17e318b90d12447cfca9bd4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
